1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,140
That presentation could change your career.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,180
So why are you cleaning the kitchen?

3
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:06,780
Maya needs to send a portfolio.

4
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:08,400
She opens the folder,

5
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:09,980
sees her work, and thinks:

6
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:11,620
what if this isn’t good enough?

7
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:13,095
One message later,

8
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:14,180
she’s checking the weather.

9
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:15,940
Then she’s comparing apps.

10
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:16,800
She’s busy.

11
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:18,680
The portfolio hasn’t moved.

12
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:19,975
Maybe the problem isn’t

13
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,080
that she doesn’t care.

14
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:22,915
Maybe this task matters enough

15
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:24,040
to feel uncomfortable,

16
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,315
and the smaller tasks

17
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:26,720
offer an easy escape.

18
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:28,380
Watch what she changes.

19
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:30,895
“Finish my portfolio” becomes

20
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:32,115
“Choose one project

21
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:33,980
and write three rough sentences.”

22
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:35,940
Not impressive sentences.

23
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:37,140
Rough ones.

24
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:39,180
She leaves her phone in the other room,

25
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:40,640
sits down, and writes.

26
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:42,360
The first sentence is awkward.

27
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:43,540
She keeps it anyway.

28
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:44,955
Ten minutes later,

29
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:46,700
the portfolio isn’t finished.

30
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,195
But there’s something on the page,

31
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:49,640
and a next-step note.

32
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:51,360
Pick the task you’re avoiding.

33
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:53,180
Name the uncomfortable part.

34
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:55,360
Then choose one action you can do.

35
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:57,115
You don’t need a perfect start.

36
00:00:57,140 --> 00:00:59,060
You need a place to begin.
